  "goodToKnow": "Das Nummernschild is a number plate; the official term is das Kfz-Kennzeichen. The first one to three letters show the district: B for Berlin, M for Munich, HH for Hansestadt Hamburg, K for Cologne. Since 2012, many old district codes have been reintroduced (Kennzeichenliberalisierung), and people pick Wunschkennzeichen with their initials. Plural: die Nummernschilder."
